    {
      "beat_id": "NB02",
      "act": "2 wrong-guess",
      "narration_text": "Picture the solo builder: ten ideas on sticky notes, a few hours a week, and a steady pull toward whatever's most fun to build. Left alone, you chase the interesting feature. Discipline points the other way — toward the one that actually moves the product — and the plugin keeps pulling you back toward it.",
